### Current milestone

* Seven OVS bridges created and connected to Ryu.

* All seven switches discovered.

* All seven bidirectional links discovered.

* Controller and discovery logs working.

* Explicit primary/alternate forwarding rules and test endpoints not yet configured.

Research caveat: Your OVS bridges use `datapath_type=netdev` because the Jetson kernel Open vSwitch module was unavailable. This setup is suitable for a functional prototype, but you should document the userspace datapath when reporting performance results; its latency and throughput may differ substantially from a kernel datapath.

